OL,3,GNEWSAFish researchers could get
OL,4,Aaccommodation by labs
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists could soon be able to stay
OL,7,Fovernight next to the fish they are
OL,8,Fresearching.
OL,10,FThe University of Plymouth has applied
OL,11,Fto Torbay Council for permission to
OL,12,Fconvert an unused store building at
OL,13,FFreshwater Quarry in Brixham into
OL,14,Faccommodation for PhD students working
OL,15,Fon research into juvenile sole.
OL,17,FAccording to the planning application,
OL,18,Fthe development would create two twin
OL,19,Fsuites for research students using the
OL,20,Funiversity's specialised marine
OL,21,Flaboratories to study Dover sole.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
