OL,3,GNEWSAFish researchers could get
OL,4,Aaccommodation by labs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university said, because testing
OL,7,Ftook place around the clock, students
OL,8,Fcurrently had to leave the site late at
OL,9,Fnight or sleep in the laboratories
OL,10,Fthemselves.
